OL,3,GNEWSADickens writing chalet placed on
OL,4,A'at risk' list
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chalet where Charles Dickens wrote
OL,7,Fsome of his most famous works has been
OL,8,Fadded to Historic England's Heritage at
OL,9,FRisk Register.
OL,11,FThe Grade I-listed Swiss chalet in
OL,12,FRochester has become increasingly
OL,13,Ffragile and in need of repair, Historic
OL,14,FEngland said, and its poor condition,
OL,15,Fwith timber decay and structural
OL,16,Finstability, has prevented public
OL,17,Faccess.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
