OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADickens writing chalet placed on
OL,4,A'at risk' list
OL,5,
OL,6,FDickens used the chalet to write novels
OL,7,Fincluding Our Mutual Friend, The
OL,8,FUncommercial Traveller, and his final,
OL,9,Funfinished work, The Mystery of Edwin
OL,10,FDrood.
OL,12,FThis year, a #240,000 lottery grant was
OL,13,Fannounced to restore the chalet and
OL,14,Fopen it to the public. Funding also
OL,15,Fincludes #40,000 from Medway council
OL,16,Fand #5,000 from the Dickens Fellowship.
